VALUES ('n2yaCnwiWoROkFeLMEM2', 'AQDCp4OWJvezauYMdeR8qaMbj6S2', '{"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Annapantsu%20They''re%20Only%20Human%20(feat.%20Caleb%20Hyles)%20official%20audio","album":"They''re Only Human (feat. Caleb Hyles) - Single","artwork":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music211/v4/5a/18/3b/5a183b54-6791-e7e8-1027-46f46a103df8/291279.jpg/600x600bb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/7f/e6/8e/7fe68e73-9f64-edf3-04d7-d2e221fe8391/mzaf_8080701478973330861.plus.aac.p.m4a","id":"itunes-1748193672","durationMs":161029,"title":"They''re Only Human (feat. Caleb Hyles)","youtubeMusicUrl":"https://music.youtube.com/search?q=Annapantsu%20They''re%20Only%20Human%20(feat.%20Caleb%20Hyles)","genre":"Pop","trackViewUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/theyre-only-human-feat-caleb-hyles/1748193669?i=1748193672&uo=4","youtubeEmbedUrl":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed?listType=search&list=Annapantsu%20They''re%20Only%20Human%20(feat.%20Caleb%20Hyles)&autoplay=1","artist":"Annapantsu"}'::jsonb, 5, 'isn''t it a farce?', 'I love the composition a lot. The two voices diverge and converge, one that deigns not to care and the other intrigued by the play, Though both agree that this is a mere ploy for them.', '', 'Aggressive / Hype', ARRAY['#Masterpiece', '#HiddenGem', '#HeavyRotation']::text[], '2026-09-04T00:17:33.666Z'::timestamptz)
