VALUES ('w7P8n1wYMwLnFGy5o2D6', 'kwXsKn7BsgYDrGVnEKSodnfAepi1', '{"title":"Ordinary Person (From \"Leo\")","artwork":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music116/v4/dd/48/45/dd4845e3-3add-7d7d-88e9-391eac68ef2a/196871570916.jpg/600x600bb.jpg","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Anirudh%20Ravichander%20%26%20Nikhita%20Gandhi%20Ordinary%20Person%20(From%20%22Leo%22)%20official%20audio","genre":"Tamil","id":"itunes-1713200602","trackViewUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/ordinary-person-from-leo/1713200442?i=1713200602&uo=4","album":"Ordinary Person (From \"Leo\") - Single","youtubeMusicUrl":"https://music.youtube.com/search?q=Anirudh%20Ravichander%20%26%20Nikhita%20Gandhi%20Ordinary%20Person%20(From%20%22Leo%22)","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/bd/9c/ef/bd9cefa8-4b0e-6541-0b91-3a82fe4c73ed/mzaf_10594549979639196209.plus.aac.p.m4a","artist":"Anirudh Ravichander & Nikhita Gandhi","durationMs":139200,"youtubeEmbedUrl":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed?listType=search&list=Anirudh%20Ravichander%20%26%20Nikhita%20Gandhi%20Ordinary%20Person%20(From%20%22Leo%22)&autoplay=1"}'::jsonb, 5, 'This song feels a little too much like me.', 'This one feels personal. I love how this song chooses peace over power. The lyrics are so simple, but “I don''t want the crown” hits differently it feels like choosing a quiet life over constantly trying to prove yourself...', 'I don’t want the crown. I just want peace.', 'Reflective', ARRAY['#HeavyRotation', '#HiddenGem', '#Masterpiece']::text[], '2026-09-03T11:56:44.037Z'::timestamptz)
